{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21959","headline":"放鹰 · 白居易","name":"放鹰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十月鹰出笼，草枯雉兔肥。\n下韝随指顾，百掷无一遗。\n鹰翅疾如风，鹰爪利如锥。\n本爲鸟所设，今爲人所资。\n孰能使之然，有术甚易知。\n取其向背性，制在饥饱时。\n不可使长饱，不可使长饥。\n饥则力不足，饱则背人飞。\n乘饥纵搏击，未饱须絷维。\n所以爪翅功，而人坐收之。\n圣明驭英雄，其术亦如斯。\n鄙语不可弃，吾闻诸猎师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}